{
  "part": "1910",
  "sections": [
    {
      "html": "<section class=\"reg-unit\" id=\"u-a\" data-unit=\"a\"><div class=\"reg-body\"><p class=\"reg-p lvl-1\" id=\"p1\"><span class=\"pmark\">(a)</span> <strong class=\"runin\">Scope.</strong> This section covers hazardous waste operations. Waste defined under <a class=\"xref xref-cross\" href=\"#/title/40/section/261.3\">40 CFR 261.3</a> and materials listed in <a class=\"xref xref-cross\" href=\"#/title/49/section/172.101\">49 CFR 172.101</a> are covered. See also § <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#/title/29/section/1910.134\">1910.134</a> and § <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#/title/29/section/1910.1200\">1910.1200</a>.</p></div></section>",
      "id": "1910.120",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "§ 1910.120",
      "reserved": false,
      "title": "Hazardous waste operations and emergency response."
    },
    {
      "html": "<section class=\"reg-unit\" id=\"u-a\" data-unit=\"a\"><div class=\"reg-body\"><p class=\"reg-p lvl-1\" id=\"p1\"><span class=\"pmark\">(a)</span> <strong class=\"runin\">Permissible practice.</strong> Respirators shall be provided.</p></div></section>",
      "id": "1910.134",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "§ 1910.134",
      "reserved": false,
      "title": "Respiratory protection."
    },
    {
      "html": "<section class=\"reg-unit\" id=\"u-a\" data-unit=\"a\"><div class=\"reg-body\"><p class=\"reg-p lvl-1\" id=\"p1\"><span class=\"pmark\">(a)</span> <strong class=\"runin\">General requirements.</strong> The employer shall ensure that each affected employee wears a protective helmet.</p></div></section><section class=\"reg-unit\" id=\"u-b\" data-unit=\"b\"><div class=\"reg-body\"><p class=\"reg-p lvl-1\" id=\"p2\"><span class=\"pmark\">(b)</span> <strong class=\"runin\">Criteria.</strong> Helmets shall comply with ANSI Z89.1.</p></div></section>",
      "id": "1910.135",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "§ 1910.135",
      "reserved": false,
      "title": "Head protection."
    },
